This work is a derivative of the excellent work done by the folks at cybrosys that can be found here:
https://github.com/CybroOdoo/CybroAddons/tree/17.0/face_recognized_attendance_login.

Contrary to the work done by cybrosys, this module add geolocation and liveness detection to prevent
attendance fraud.

When using the module, once the camera is active, you will need to vary your facial expression between
smiling, surprised and tight-lipped for 5 to 10 seconds to be successful during identification.
In addition, the place where you perform your facial recognition must be well lit.
So, from their smartphone equipped with a GPS chip and a camera (which is the case for the vast majority
of entry-level smartphones), employees can now clock in and out without any hassle and the company has
the assurance that the risks of fraud have been curbed.